<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

	<!--
		The three thoughts behind the two new genes (built 2026-09-30, CASTES-PLAN.md
		phase 1). Mood cannot live on a gene and an opinion cannot live on a stat, so
		both halves sit here and Source/Insects/ supplies the workers:
		`ThoughtWorker_DisorientatingLights` and `ThoughtWorker_Quarrel`.

		The two quarrel defs are social situational thoughts, and that is load
		bearing. A `ThoughtDef` is only collected once per other pawn when its
		`thoughtClass` is `Thought_SituationalSocial` - the default for a def with a
		worker and no duration is `Thought_Situational`, which has no other pawn at
		all, so the opinion would silently never apply. Vanilla's own examples are
		Core/Defs/ThoughtDefs/Thoughts_Situation_Social.xml and Anomaly's
		Thoughts_Situational_Social.xml, and the shape below is theirs.

		-50 is the decided number (2026-09-30), for both. The beetle's is mutual
		because its gene names itself; the hornet's is one way because its gene names
		the honey gene, and a honey bee carries no thought about hornets.
	-->
	<ThoughtDef>
		<defName>PMM_Thought_DisorientatingLights</defName>
		<workerClass>PMM_Insects.ThoughtWorker_DisorientatingLights</workerClass>
		<stages>
			<li>
				<label>giddy in the light</label>
				<baseMoodEffect>10</baseMoodEffect>
				<description>She is standing in a light bright enough to make her happy and a little unsteady.</description>
			</li>
		</stages>
	</ThoughtDef>

	<ThoughtDef>
		<defName>PMM_Thought_Quarrelsome</defName>
		<thoughtClass>Thought_SituationalSocial</thoughtClass>
		<workerClass>PMM_Insects.ThoughtWorker_Quarrel</workerClass>
		<validWhileDespawned>true</validWhileDespawned>
		<stages>
			<li>
				<label>quarrelsome kin</label>
				<baseOpinionOffset>-50</baseOpinionOffset>
				<description>The two of them cannot share a room. Her own kind grates on her, and she on them.</description>
			</li>
		</stages>
	</ThoughtDef>

	<ThoughtDef>
		<defName>PMM_Thought_HoneyHatred</defName>
		<thoughtClass>Thought_SituationalSocial</thoughtClass>
		<workerClass>PMM_Insects.ThoughtWorker_Quarrel</workerClass>
		<validWhileDespawned>true</validWhileDespawned>
		<stages>
			<li>
				<label>smell of honey</label>
				<baseOpinionOffset>-50</baseOpinionOffset>
				<description>Hornets were built to fight bees, and the smell of honey is enough to set her teeth.</description>
			</li>
		</stages>
	</ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
